        "<strong>直线路径回归</strong>：以线性插值 <span class=\"kb-math kb-math-inline\">X_t = (1-t)X_0 + tX_1</span> 为中间状态，用最小二乘回归速度场 <span class=\"kb-math kb-math-inline\">v_\\theta(X_t, t) \\approx X_1 - X_0</span>，训练目标与 Flow Matching / DDPM 连续形式等价",
